WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.384
Okay Josh, day one.

2
00:00:01.384 --> 00:00:03.944
Brand-new app to your first matches.

3
00:00:03.944 --> 00:00:04.566
Let's go.

4
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.117
Open the app:

5
00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:08.441
just double-click do good talent.

6
00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:10.559
On a Mac, it's in Applications.

7
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:13.542
The first time, your Mac wants a yes.

8
00:00:13.542 --> 00:00:16.362
Settings, Privacy and Security, Open Anyway.

9
00:00:16.362 --> 00:00:16.989
Just once.

10
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.773
It opens empty.

11
00:00:18.773 --> 00:00:19.726
Three steps:

12
00:00:19.726 --> 00:00:22.512
your key, your contractors, your jobs.

13
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.593
First, grab your link.

14
00:00:24.593 --> 00:00:27.680
Open your contractor Sheet and click the Setup tab.

15
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.833
This is your do good link.

16
00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:31.922
Click it and copy.

17
00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.994
Back in the app, hit Paste your do good link.

18
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:39.819
Hit Paste.

19
00:00:39.819 --> 00:00:41.455
It shows as dots.

20
00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:44.604
Test link.

21
00:00:44.604 --> 00:00:46.033
Boom:

22
00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:48.495
thirty contractors and four jobs found.

23
00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:53.208
Save link, and it loads everyone by itself.

24
00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:54.251
Done.

25
00:00:54.251 --> 00:00:55.981
Two ticked, one to go:

26
00:00:55.981 --> 00:00:56.583
the key.

27
00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.201
No key yet?

28
00:00:58.201 --> 00:00:59.737
Hit Where do I get one.

29
00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:05.283
It opens Google AI Studio.

30
00:01:05.283 --> 00:01:08.647
Sign in, hit Create API key, and copy it.

31
00:01:08.647 --> 00:01:09.448
It's free.

32
00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:12.875
Then Add your key.

33
00:01:13.845 --> 00:01:16.850
Paste it, hit Save key.

34
00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:18.622
It stays on your computer.

35
00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:19.820
Last one:

36
00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:21.037
Settings, Your name.

37
00:01:21.037 --> 00:01:22.312
It signs your emails.

38
00:01:22.312 --> 00:01:23.945
Type it, hit Save name.

39
00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:27.397
Back on Home.

40
00:01:27.397 --> 00:01:29.368
Big button:

41
00:01:29.368 --> 00:01:30.312
Find matches.

42
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.633
It reads each job against every contractor.

43
00:01:34.633 --> 00:01:36.886
You can keep working while it runs.

44
00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:38.956
Done, twelve matches.

45
00:01:38.956 --> 00:01:39.695
Hit Review.

46
00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:43.326
Here's the first one.

47
00:01:43.326 --> 00:01:45.720
Approve, Needs info, or Reject.

48
00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:47.590
Next video shows you how.

49
00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.820
That's it for day one:

50
00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:53.483
open it, paste the link, key and name, find matches.
